Third-party algorithm and license notes:

1. Counter-based hash (src/foundation: hdrgrading/foundation/hash.h, the dithering and noise)
   Its mixing function is lowbias32 by Chris Wellons, from hash-prospector
   (https://github.com/skeeto/hash-prospector), dedicated to the public domain
   (The Unlicense). The odd constants of its word positions are the prime
   constants of xxHash32 (https://github.com/Cyan4973/xxHash). Credited as a
   courtesy: no code of either project is included.

2. Bundled dependencies under third_party/ keep their own licenses:
   - jpegli (google/jpegli): BSD-3-Clause
   - Highway (a submodule of jpegli, built with jpegli and libjxl): Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause
   - zlib: zlib License
   - libjpeg-turbo (jpegli's vendored headers): IJG / BSD-3-Clause / zlib
   - libpng: PNG Reference Library License v2
   - giflib: MIT
   - Little-CMS (lcms2): MIT
   - libjxl (libjxl/libjxl, third_party/libjxl; the JPEG XL writer, the jxl family):
     BSD-3-Clause, with the patent grant of its PATENTS file
   - Brotli (google/brotli, third_party/brotli; with libjxl): MIT
   - AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1 (GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-FSR,
     third_party/fidelityfx-fsr): MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 Advanced Micro
     Devices, Inc. Its EASU and RCAS are ported to C and WGSL
     (src/plugins/fsr: fsr.h, fsr.c, wgsl/fsr.wgsl, keeping its notice);
     the submodule is their reference, not compiled.
   - NVIDIA Image Scaling (NVIDIAGameWorks/NVIDIAImageScaling, third_party/nis):
     MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. Its scaler is
     ported to C and WGSL (src/plugins/nis: nis.h, nis.c, wgsl/nis.wgsl,
     keeping its notice); its filter tables are compiled from its
     NIS/NIS_Config.h (generated nis_coefs.c).
   - Unity (ThrowTheSwitch, test framework): MIT
   - SDL 3 (libsdl-org/SDL, third_party/sdl; hdrg-gui only, HDRG_BUILD_GUI): zlib License
   - Dear ImGui (ocornut/imgui, third_party/imgui; hdrg-gui only, HDRG_BUILD_GUI): MIT
   - VapourSynth: LGPL-2.1-or-later. Only its API header (VapourSynth4.h:
     declarations and macros) is used to build the plugin in
     src/bindings/vapoursynth; no VapourSynth code is compiled into or linked
     with the library or the plugin, which loads into VapourSynth at run time.
   - FFmpeg (libavutil / libavcodec / libavformat / libswscale): LGPL-2.1-or-later
